        "Description": "A contract has been issued 47. Your Targets are two men who are getting a bit to close to ICA secrets we want buried\r\rKhaatim Ali works event security and is a member of a political party advocating for free speech and has through his campaigning gotten some dangerous conections who want to see ICA fall. Take him down 47\r\rZana Kazemi &quot;The Vulture&quot; is a freelance Journalist who always goes that extra mile for his stories, this time he has actually found something big, make sure it never gets out.",
